POST {{PAYMENTS_URL}}/pagos/orden/{{ordenC.response.body.$.id}}/comprobante
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN_CLIENTE}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Pagos04Boundary

